 "reporting": "Percent resistant (%R) with number tested per drug, by organism and specimen (blood, pus aspirate, urine, other sterile body fluids), all locations pooled; blood %R by location (inpatient, ICU, and for S. aureus and Klebsiella outpatient) as chart data labels without numbers tested. Isolate counts by specimen and by location.",
 "method": "13 sentinel laboratories (11 government, 2 private medical colleges) in 10 districts; WHONET; NCDC AMR surveillance SOP; CLSI interpretation except colistin MIC, interpreted by EUCAST; colistin by broth microdilution; duplicates removed (15,752 reported isolates to 14,616 unique-patient isolates).",
